{
  spec: "[TSON-DATA] §8.2, §9.1 (the processor policy's vocabulary, proposed)"
  description: "A deployment that writes its policy down writes a `policy.processor`, leaving out the data version and any limit it does not raise. Every limit is a `policy.limit`, a positive `int64`, so the widest is 2^63-1."
